      "scope": "Position-update helper computes a signed-saturating new size from a supplied old-size pointer and signed input magnitude. New zero clears row+0x30; same-sign movement in the original direction adds input+0x258 with unsigned saturation, opposite movement scales the previous value by new/old with a bounded binary64 cast, and opening or crossing zero uses checked input+0x248 times absolute new size capped at I64_MAX-1. Raw field roles, error paths and downstream helper boundaries are retained; no complete fill or accounting equivalence is claimed.",
